      "side": 1,
      "message": "So should I assign the following default values in the struct - \nFor sdkContext and ClassLoaderContexts \u003d\u003e nil \nand for all the boolean values \u003d\u003e false \nand for string \u003d\u003e empty string \u003d \"\"\n\nFor Ctx and Manifest we can avoid having a default value because they are essential to pass.",
